.github.com/users/JamesMowery/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-07T22:51:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-07T23:05:09Z","body":"![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70f1554c-0ec0-4a27-9528-24848ce75e19)\n\nI can confirm that I am also seeing this error after having followed [these instructions](https://stackoverflow.com/a/76039025) to essentially clear out my project (leaving the config files, the git addon, and all my existing assets, and removing all code) to start a rewrite from scratch.\n\n```\ngit checkout --orphan orphan\ngit rm -rf . // or in my case, everything except addons & assets folders, and export_presets.cfg\ngit clean --force -d\n```\n\nI am on Arch Linux, using Godot v4.4 dev 7.\n\n(Update: I tried going in and deleting every single file from the project, just to see if that would fix it, but the error still shows.)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2576376201/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594155944","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99832#issuecomment-2594155944","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99832","id":2594155944,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6an62o","user":{"login":"GitHubPiotr","id":60047367,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDQ3MzY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60047367?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr","html_url":"https://github.com/GitHubPiotr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GitHubPiotr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-15T23:40:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-16T09:38:49Z","body":"@JamesMowery \n\nI had the same problem and I have solved it.\n\nTry to:\n1. Delete each line with UID reference in project.godot file (like custom cursors).\n2. Remove custom themes from Project Settings\n3. Remove custom themes from Editor Settings\n4. Remove all *.import files\n5. Remove all *.uid files\n6. Open your project and use this script in Godot Editor (File -> Run or Ctrl+Shift+ X)\n\n```\n@tool\nextends EditorScript\n\nvar files: Array[String]\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tfiles = []\n\t\n\tadd_files(\"res://\")\n\t\n\tfor file in files:\n\t\tprint(file)\n\t\tvar res = load(file)\n\t\tResourceSaver.save(res)\n\nfunc add_files(dir: String):\n\tfor file in DirAccess.get_files_at(dir):\n\t\tif file.get_extension() == \"tscn\" or file.get_extension() == \"tres\":\n\t\t\tfiles.append(dir.path_join(file))\n\t\n\tfor dr in DirAccess.get_directories_at(dir):\n\t\tadd_files(dir.path_join(dr))\n```\n\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2594155944/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2815583701","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99832#issuecomment-2815583701","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/is